Database schema changes are managed with Alembic.

Apply migrations from the repository root with:

    .venv/bin/alembic upgrade head

The target database is selected with LAB_DATABASE_URL. Generate a revision after
updating the SQLAlchemy models with:

    .venv/bin/alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe schema change"

Review autogenerated migrations before applying them. Do not edit an applied
migration; add a new revision instead.
